This A/P Caller is designed to call ranged spikes and deprot targets at the same time.

== Skills and Attributes ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=Assassin/Paragon SpearMastery=10 Command=10 CriticalStrikes=11+1+1][Song of Concentration]["Make Haste!"][Vicious Attack]["Go for the Eyes!" (PvP)][Disrupting Throw][Dark Apostasy][Critical Eye][Way of the Master][/build]
</pvxbig>
== Equipment ==
'''Runes and insignia'''
*5 [[gww:Blessed Insignia|blessed insignias]].
*Rune of [[gww:Rune of Vigor|superior vigor]].
*3 runes of [[gww:Rune of Vitae|vitae]].

'''Weapons'''
*[[gww:Swift|Swift]] staff of [[gww:Of Enchanting|enchanting]], [[gww:Inscription#Combat enhancing|+5e^ench]].
*[[gww:Vampiric|Vampiric]] spear of [[gww:Of Defense|defense]], [[gww:Inscription#Combat enhancing|15^50]] with
**Command shield of [[gww:Of Fortitude|fortitude]], [[gww:Inscription#Combat_enhancing_2|-20% blind duration]].
**Command shield of fortitude, -20% cripple duration.
**Command shields of fortitude, +10 armor against each damage type.

== Usage ==
<pvxbig>
*Maintain your enchantments and [[Critical Eye@13].
*Call spikes. Prioritize balling targets, targets in their cast set, targets carrying a relic or suffering from death penalty.
**Use [[Vicious Attack@10] first, then [["Go for the Eyes!" (PvP)@10] while your spear is mid-air. Use [[Disrupting Throw@10] for additional damage.
*Use [[Song of Concentration] on king of the hill maps to make sure that your ghostly heroes can capture the altar.
*Use [["Make Haste!"@10] on relic run maps to increase both your runners' movement speed.
</pvxbig>

